    "Name": "Desert Scorpion",
    "Details": "The Desert Scorpion mounts a Large Laser powered by a fusion engine, freeing it from ammunition worries, while also having a similar range profile as it's cannon equipped peers and mounting nearly twice as much armor as the average Scorpion. The Scorpion Light Tank is famously easy to repair, available in numbers, and best of all, cheap. The vehicle is produced on many planets within the Free Worlds League.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       175     15\n<b>Left</b>         110     15\n<b>Right</b>       110     15\n<b>Rear</b>         90     15\n<b>Turret</b>      125     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      610     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Protected Mechanisms</color>",
